Patch 7932: PREP_PIPE=1 runs render_frame_prepare on the PIPE submit thread (off by default; only with PIPE on).

measured steps P1-P4 and split part 1: prepare works on the handed-off batch (always), the FIFO thread waits for the GPU
itself before recording into the ring half the previous batch used, the submit thread runs prepare + submit, a label
gate holds the game's view of the next batch's labels / semaphores / reports until the previous prepare finished, and the
batch's fragment programs are copied at the hand-off. Measured: live 2 Players 3v3 with PIPE=1 + 7929-7931,
25.85 / 29.11 / 26.98 / 29.54 flips/s (off / on / off / on), replay bit-exact.

